:name: HWA10 live
:description: Interactive run: real-time pacing, the panel in an analyzer window,
:  and the monitor reachable over TCP for input. Start Renode without
:  --disable-xwt and with --port 12345, then e.g.
:    printf 'twi0.crown Rotate 1\n' | nc -q 1 localhost 12345

include @scripts/machine.resc

runMacro $fastStartup

showAnalyzer sysbus.spi3
start
